# Commits

- 3377e1c fix(router): read an accepted stream under the caller's timeout
- 0c21d53 fix(provider): carry image input to Ollama and state DeepSeek's modality
- 9947937 feat(claude): menu control for feedback drafts, off by default
- 2638497 docs(journal): record the timeout, vision, feedback and combo findings
- 64ec9c4 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/nightly' into nightly-20261020
  (brings the published 625faed truncated-summary retry)

Pushed to nightly-20261020 and nightly (3885e64 -> 64ec9c4).

