# Local install

- npm global updated to the nightly (`npm install -g ...@nightly`).
- The package's install.ps1 copied it into the runtime home
  C:\Users\djlov\.local\share\ciel-runtime and pinned CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME there.
- `ciel-runtime version` from that home prints
  0.2.51-nightly.20261022-060129.64ec9c4, and the five fixes plus 625faed's
  truncated-summary retry are all present in the installed files.

